silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_5_P_B_#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode5 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode5 is the set of vet records of type B observed for Mittens, concretely the first-week body-mass and ownership records at visit_1. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P(B)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
